# OpenProject MCP Skill

**Server:** openproject  
**URL:** https://mcp.baisoln.com/openproject/mcp  
**Transport:** HTTP  
**Multi-tenant:** Yes (tenant_id required)

## When to use

- Creating or updating work packages, tasks, stories, epics
- Storing or retrieving project documents in OpenProject
- Querying project status, assignees, or timelines
- Any work management or document storage that should live in OpenProject

## Usage

Reference this skill with `@mcp-skills/openproject` when you need work management or document storage. For BMAD workflows, also use @bmad/integrations/openproject. Pass the correct `tenant_id` and use exact tool names from the MCP server.

## Notes

- Use OpenProject for ALL work management and document storage when the project uses it.
- Verify tool names before coding; wrong names cause silent failures.
